# Code owners for the public HealthPipe repo.
#
# On GitHub, a PR that touches a matching path auto-requests review from the owner(s)
# below; combined with branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners") this
# enforces maintainer sign-off. Governance (CODEOWNERS + branch protection) is tracked
# in story 28519.
#
# IMPORTANT: the team below MUST exist in the `enversion-journl` org (Org -> Teams)
# before this file has any effect — GitHub silently ignores unknown owners. Rename it to
# the actual maintainer team at cut-over if different.

# Default owner for everything in the repo.
*                           @enversion-journl/healthpipe-maintainers

# CI / security / governance config — keep explicitly maintainer-owned.
/.github/                   @enversion-journl/healthpipe-maintainers
/pyproject.toml             @enversion-journl/healthpipe-maintainers
/.pre-commit-config.yaml    @enversion-journl/healthpipe-maintainers
/.gitleaks.toml             @enversion-journl/healthpipe-maintainers
